config DEMO_I3C_SENSOR
	tristate "Educational I3C temperature sensor"
	depends on I3C && HWMON
	help
	  Build a study-only Linux 6.18 driver for a fictional I3C sensor.

	  The example demonstrates PID-based matching, private SDR transfers,
	  hwmon registration, IBI allocation/handling, and teardown. It must be
	  adapted to a real target datasheet and target kernel API.

